                                "sense_id": "f163a87f-1146-3276-9b5f-887c49930879",
                                "text": "A great, sweet lady like you wouldn't think it, of course, but it's a godsend at times for a lone woman when she's ugly enough to turn cream sour, and somedeal crooked o' the body into the bargain."
